    "name": "Route Academy - Route Posts API",
    "description": "<html><head></head><body><img src=\"https://content.pstmn.io/6eea5c8b-f51d-4b1c-8acd-b8799d80944e/cm91dGUucG5n\" alt=\"Route%20Academy%20Logo\" height=\"284\" width=\"270\">\n\n<h2 id=\"about-route-academy\">About Route Academy</h2>\n<p>Route Academy is Egypt's leading Information Technology training center, established in 2012. We specialize in delivering high-quality training in programming, web development, and app development.</p>\n<p>This collection includes all API endpoints for Route Posts with ready-to-run examples.</p>\n<h2 id=\"standard-response-shape\">Standard Response Shape</h2>\n<p>All endpoints return a unified format:</p>\n<pre class=\"click-to-expand-wrapper is-snippet-wrapper\"><code class=\"language-json\">{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"...\",\n  \"data\": {},\n  \"meta\": {}\n}\n\n</code></pre>\n<p>Error format:</p>\n<pre class=\"click-to-expand-wrapper is-snippet-wrapper\"><code class=\"language-json\">{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"...\",\n  \"errors\": \"...\"\n}\n\n</code></pre>\n</body></html>",
